I am working at my desk in the office.
Priya comes to me with her laptop.
"Maya, can you look at the new designs?" Priya asks.
"Yes Priya, show me," I say.
She shows me the new designs of the app on the screen.
The designs are very clean and beautiful.
"This is very good work," I say, smiling.
Priya points to a button.
"Is it easy to write the code for this?" she asks.
"Yes, it is not very difficult," I reply.
We quickly look at the rest of the work as well.
I remember how worried we were a few weeks ago.
Then the new update for our big project had come.
We had a lot of stress at that time.
But now that same update has become normal everyday work.
Now we work without any trouble.
"Alright, I will write this code today itself," I tell Priya.
"Thank you Maya!"
Priya smiles and goes back to her desk.
I comfortably get back to my work.
The project work finishes early today.
